      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30BD\u30D5\u30A3\u30FC",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Sophie"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 31,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u305D\u306E\u8ABF\u5B50\u3067\u3059\u3001\u30BD\u30D5\u30A3\u30FC\u3002\n\u79C1\u3092\u3046\u306A\u3089\u305B\u308B\u3088\u3046\u306A\u3082\u306E\u3092\u671F\u5F85\u3057\u3066\u3044\u307E\u3059\u3088",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "That\u0027s the spirit, Sophie.\nI\u0027m expecting something that will truly impress me."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30D7\u30E9\u30D5\u30BF",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Plachta"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 32,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u3046\u3093\uFF01\u3000\u2026\u2026\u3042\u308C\uFF1F\u3000\u3082\u3057\u304B\u3057\u3066\u30D7\u30E9\u30D5\u30BF\u3001\n\u305F\u3060\u304A\u83D3\u5B50\u3092\u98DF\u3079\u305F\u3044\u3060\u3051\u3060\u3063\u305F\u308A\uFF1F",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Yeah! ...Wait a minute. Plachta, could it be\nyou just want to eat sweets?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30BD\u30D5\u30A3\u30FC",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Sophie"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 33,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u2026\u2026\u92ED\u3044\u3067\u3059\u306D\u3002\u3069\u3046\u3082\u3053\u306E\u8EAB\u4F53\u306B\u306A\u308B\u3068\n\u5473\u899A\u304C\u623B\u3063\u3066\u3044\u308B\u306E\u304B\u3001\u98DF\u6B32\u304C\u5897\u3059\u3088\u3046\u3067\u3059",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "...Sharp observation. It seems when I take this form,\nmy sense of taste returns and my appetite increases."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30D7\u30E9\u30D5\u30BF",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Plachta"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 34,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u30E9\u30F3\u30BF\u30FC\u30CA\u306B\u6765\u3066\u304B\u3089\u3001\u305F\u307E\u30FC\u306B\u3053\u3046\u3057\u3066\n\u8EAB\u4F53\u304C\u5909\u5316\u3059\u308B\u6642\u304C\u3042\u308B\u3088\u306D\u3002\u306A\u3093\u3067\u3060\u308D\u3046\uFF1F",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ever since we came to Lantarna, you\u0027ve had these\noccasional changes in your body. I wonder why?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30BD\u30D5\u30A3\u30FC",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Sophie"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 35,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u307E\u3042\u3001\u3069\u3046\u3044\u3063\u305F\u6750\u6599\u914D\u5206\u3060\u3068\u3088\u3044\u5869\u6885\u306B\u306A\u308B\u306E\u304B\u3001\n\u77E5\u308A\u305F\u3044\u3068\u3044\u3046\u6C17\u6301\u3061\u3082\u3042\u308A\u307E\u3059\u3088",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Well, I am also interested in learning\nthe proper proportions for a good balance of ingredients."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30D7\u30E9\u30D5\u30BF",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Plachta"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 36,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u3042\u306F\u306F\u3063\u3002\u306A\u308B\u307B\u3069\u306D\u3002\n\u305D\u308C\u3058\u3083\u3042\u51FA\u304B\u3051\u3088\u3046\uFF01",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ahaha! I see!\nWell then, shall we get going?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30BD\u30D5\u30A3\u30FC",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Sophie"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 37,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u306F\u3044\u3002\u4E00\u7DD2\u306B\u7F8E\u5473\u3057\u3044\u30C1\u30E7\u30B3\u3092\n\u4F5C\u308A\u307E\u3057\u3087\u3046\u3001\u30BD\u30D5\u30A3\u30FC",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Yes. Let\u0027s make some delicious\nchocolates together, Sophie."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30D7\u30E9\u30D5\u30BF",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Plachta"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 38,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u3046\u3093\uFF01",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Yeah!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30BD\u30D5\u30A3\u30FC",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Sophie"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 39,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u6717\u3089\u304B\u306A\u6027\u683C\u306E\u932C\u91D1\u8853\u58EB\u3002\n\u771F\u9762\u76EE\u306A\u52AA\u529B\u5BB6\u3060\u304C\u3001\u3084\u3084\u305A\u307C\u3089\u306A\u90E8\u5206\u3082\u3042\u308B",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "A cheerful alchemist.\nA dedicated worker, though somewhat messy at times."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30BD\u30D5\u30A3\u30FC\u30FB\u30CE\u30A4\u30A8\u30F3\u30DF\u30E5\u30E9\u30FC",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Sophie Neuenmuller"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 40,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u30BD\u30D5\u30A3\u30FC\u3068\u884C\u52D5\u3092\u5171\u306B\u3059\u308B\u932C\u91D1\u8853\u58EB\u3002\n\u8FD1\u9803\u3001\u305D\u306E\u8EAB\u4F53\u306B\u306F\u3042\u308B\u5909\u5316\u304C\u8D77\u3053\u3063\u3066\u3044\u308B",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "An alchemist who travels with Sophie.\nLately, her body has been experiencing certain changes."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30D7\u30E9\u30D5\u30BF",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Plachta"
        }
      }
    }
  }
]